{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07352","headline":"京口怀洛阳旧居兼寄广陵二三知己 · 刘长卿","name":"京口怀洛阳旧居兼寄广陵二三知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"川阔悲无梁，蔼然沧波夕。\n天涯一飞鸟，日暮南徐客。\n气混京口云，潮吞海门石。\n孤帆候风进，夜色带江白。\n一水阻佳期，相望空脉脉。\n那堪岁芳尽，更使春梦积。\n故国胡尘飞，远山楚云隔。\n家人想何在，庭草爲谁碧。\n惆怅空伤情，沧浪有余迹。\n严陵七里滩，携手同所适。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}